37
00:03:57,120 --> 00:04:06,240
Now at the hospital, Parkland Memorial Hospital, where Governor Connolly and President Kennedy were taken after the uh the shooting.

38
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:13,680
This bullet supposedly worked its way out of John Connolly's thigh and was found on the stretcher next to him.

39
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:24,640
